# Rhythm Culture

Drum Sing Dance Incursions

![](/media/2022/03/day_care_img_17-scaled.jpg)

## About Us

We encourage learning through play, rhythm and group activity. Children will gain insight into African culture with instruments, story, song, music and dance. These active, engaging workshops are loaded with activity and ensure children are being creative through social, cultural and musical education. Our Drum Sing Dance programs and drum and dance workshops develop and strengthen communication skills, encourage self esteem and self confidence, engage students in leadership activities, inspires creativity and social freedom. Contact us to receive our online brochure.

[CONTACT US](/contact-us-2/)

## DRUM SING DANCE

Drum Sing Dance incursions are exciting, educational and cultural. Every child will have their own West African drum to play and will engage in drumming, singing and dancing. Children will experience story and song whilst moving their bodies. Get active whilst learning about African music culture! Learn about what we get up to and where we go. Visit our blog to keep updated.

[Read Our Blog](/blog/)

